{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME TO NEPTUNE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/1.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Pale Deep, you'll be playing as a series of cadets in doomed missions on board &quot;The Diving Bell&quot; vessels. However, with every lost cadet, you learn a little bit more about Neptune's ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO HARM MUST COME TO THE ECOSYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/2.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have no weapons. All you have is a foghorn, a decoy launcher, and your research tools. There is no fighting, only distracting, scaring, and hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WATCH EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/3.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a camera and a radar, but just because you don't see anything on those, doesn't mean you're safe. For example, a sudden drop in temperature could indicate a presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE UNTIL YOUR EQUIPMENT, OR YOUR KNOWLEDGE FAILS YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/4.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can log everything you learn in the mission database, and you can access it any time to aid in facing familiar creatures. However, none of that matters if your equipment has buckled under the pressure, or if you've encountered something no one else has before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE YOUR EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/5.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only will we learn more about Neptune through these missions, but we'll learn how to develop better equipment. Research &amp; Development is always making progress with the help of your missions into the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS ECOSYSTEM IS UNPREDICTABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/6.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The effective tactics to defend against the inhabitants of Neptune are randomized and different for every playthrough. Knowledge of this ecosystem gained through previous playthroughs or by watching others will be useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND WHAT LIES AT THE BOTTOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/7.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep down within Neptune, lies an ocean of water and ammonia. One day, some cadet will be the first to see it, and what lies within it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771070?t=1753075637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/cd09d4b09ca982d60db1bccd952521b80c2fcf52/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753075637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/b5c5bae963c5479e075354abfdea7bfb6f93401a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753075637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/b5c5bae963c5479e075354abfdea7bfb6f93401a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753075637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELCOME TO NEPTUNE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/1.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Pale Deep, you'll be playing as a series of cadets in doomed missions on board &quot;The Diving Bell&quot; vessels. However, with every lost cadet, you learn a little bit more about Neptune's ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO HARM MUST COME TO THE ECOSYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/2.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have no weapons. All you have is a foghorn, a decoy launcher, and your research tools. There is no fighting, only distracting, scaring, and hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WATCH EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/3.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a camera and a radar, but just because you don't see anything on those, doesn't mean you're safe. For example, a sudden drop in temperature could indicate a presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE UNTIL YOUR EQUIPMENT, OR YOUR KNOWLEDGE FAILS YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/4.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can log everything you learn in the mission database, and you can access it any time to aid in facing familiar creatures. However, none of that matters if your equipment has buckled under the pressure, or if you've encountered something no one else has before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE YOUR EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/5.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only will we learn more about Neptune through these missions, but we'll learn how to develop better equipment. Research &amp; Development is always making progress with the help of your missions into the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS ECOSYSTEM IS UNPREDICTABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/6.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The effective tactics to defend against the inhabitants of Neptune are randomized and different for every playthrough. Knowledge of this ecosystem gained through previous playthroughs or by watching others will be useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND WHAT LIES AT THE BOTTOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/extras/7.gif?t=1753075637\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep down within Neptune, lies an ocean of water and ammonia. One day, some cadet will be the first to see it, and what lies within it.</p>","developers":["Caseyfromspace"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771070/136da606d5c74a2b1f59c662c695a58cb52a72eb/header.jpg?t=1753075637","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150719,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150719/movie480.mp4?t=1749873527","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150719/movie_max.mp4?t=1749873527"},"name":"The Pale Deep (Reveal Trailer)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150719/55f85616e40c962d45aa9778f0ce012a93c51b33/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749873527","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150719/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749873527","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150719/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749873527"}}],"name":"The Pale Deep","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"The Pale Deep - $8.99 USD","packageid":1326832,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":899}],"title":"Buy The Pale Deep"}],"packages":[1326832],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":899,"final_formatted":"$8.99 USD","initial":899,"initial_fo